{
  "uid": "test-flow",
  "title": "05 · Testflöde A→Ö",
  "description": "Vad hände med mina anrop, steg för steg, genom hela stacken?",
  "tags": [
    "telemetry-demo",
    "test"
  ],
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "liveNow": false,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "type": "textbox",
        "name": "test_run",
        "label": "test-run-id",
        "query": "loadgen",
        "current": {
          "text": "loadgen",
          "value": "loadgen"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "type": "textbox",
        "name": "trace_id",
        "label": "trace_id",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Chaos",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "#FFB400",
        "hide": false,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "expr": "{service_name=\"frontend\"} |= \"chaos_mode_set\" | regexp \"mode=(?P<mode>[a-z_]+)\"",
        "titleFormat": "chaos: {{mode}}",
        "textFormat": "{{mode}}",
        "tagKeys": "mode",
        "instant": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "00 · Start",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/start",
      "icon": "apps",
      "keepTime": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "targetBlank": false,
      "tooltip": "Startsidan",
      "asDropdown": false,
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "telemetry-demo"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "targetBlank": false,
      "icon": "external link"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "description": "",
      "targets": [],
      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "\n<div style=\"font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:14px;padding:4px\">\n  <div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#FFB400\">TESTFLÖDE A → Ö</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;margin-top:4px;letter-spacing:-.02em\">Vad hände med mina anrop?</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:14px;color:#D6D6D6;margin-top:6px\">Varje anrop är en trace genom hela stacken. Här ser du alla steg, i ordning, och exakt var något gick fel.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid #262626;background:#0D0D0D;padding:12px 14px\">\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#707070\">1 · KÖR</div>\n    <div style=\"color:#fff;margin-top:6px;font-size:14px\">Märk dina anrop med headern <code>x-test-run-id</code>, eller kör</div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;color:#FFB400;margin-top:6px;font-size:13px\">./scripts/e2e-test.sh</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid #262626;background:#0D0D0D;padding:12px 14px\">\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#707070\">2 · VÄLJ</div>\n    <div style=\"color:#fff;margin-top:6px;font-size:14px\">Skriv test-run-id högst upp (skriptet skriver ut länken). <code>loadgen</code> = den simulerade trafiken.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid #262626;background:#0D0D0D;padding:12px 14px\">\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#707070\">3 · FÖLJ</div>\n    <div style=\"color:#fff;margin-top:6px;font-size:14px\">Kopiera ett trace-id till <code>trace_id</code> och fäll ut ③ – eller klicka på trace-id:t för Explore.</div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext"
        }
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "② Testkörningen · $test_run",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Alla anrop i testkörningen",
      "description": "Ett anrop per rad, senaste först. Status ≥ 400 och tid över 3 s är gula. Kopiera trace_id till variabeln högst upp för att följa anropet A→Ö i ③, eller klicka på Span för att öppna det i Explore.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"frontend\" && kind = server && span.test.run.id = \"$test_run\" } | select(span.http.response.status_code, span.http.route)",
          "limit": 100,
          "tableType": "spans",
          "spss": 3,
          "filters": []
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "filterable": false
          },
          "links": []
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Status"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "range",
                    "options": {
                      "from": 200,
                      "to": 399,
                      "result": {
                        "color": "#FFFFFF",
                        "index": 0
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "range",
                    "options": {
                      "from": 400,
                      "to": 599,
                      "result": {
                        "color": "#FFB400",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Tid"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ns"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "value": null,
                      "color": "#FFFFFF"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": 3000000000.0,
                      "color": "#FFB400"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "thresholds"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        }
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "renameByName": {
              "Start time": "Start",
              "Name": "Steg",
              "Duration": "Tid",
              "Span ID": "Span",
              "traceIdHidden": "trace_id",
              "http.response.status_code": "Status",
              "http.route": "Route"
            },
            "excludeByName": {
              "Trace Service": true,
              "Trace Name": true,
              "kind": true,
              "Name": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "Start time": 0,
              "http.response.status_code": 1,
              "Duration": 2,
              "http.route": 3,
              "traceIdHidden": 4,
              "Span ID": 5
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Start",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 13,
        "h": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Fel i testkörningen · exakt var",
      "description": "Varje span med status ERROR under en rot-span i testkörningen: vilken tjänst, vilket steg, vilken feltyp, och för agenten vilken nod och vilket verktyg. Tomt = inga fel.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ span.test.run.id = \"$test_run\" } >> { status = error } | select(resource.service.name, span.error.type, span.langgraph.node, span.gen_ai.tool.name, span.http.response.status_code)",
          "limit": 100,
          "tableType": "spans",
          "spss": 10,
          "filters": []
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "filterable": false
          },
          "links": []
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Tid"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ns"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Feltyp"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#FFB400"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        }
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "renameByName": {
              "Start time": "Start",
              "Name": "Steg",
              "Duration": "Tid",
              "Span ID": "Span",
              "traceIdHidden": "trace_id",
              "service.name": "Tjänst",
              "error.type": "Feltyp",
              "langgraph.node": "Nod",
              "gen_ai.tool.name": "Verktyg",
              "http.response.status_code": "HTTP"
            },
            "excludeByName": {
              "Trace Service": true,
              "Trace Name": true,
              "kind": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "Start time": 0,
              "service.name": 1,
              "Name": 2,
              "error.type": 3,
              "langgraph.node": 4,
              "gen_ai.tool.name": 5,
              "http.response.status_code": 6,
              "Duration": 7,
              "traceIdHidden": 8,
              "Span ID": 9
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 13,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 11,
        "h": 12
      }
